### per-prime timings of ellpadicregulator, paper Section 5.3 (ssec:scan)
pari version      : [2, 17, 2]
curve             : y^2 = x^3 - 56x   [0,0,0,-56,0]
MW basis          : (8,8), (9,15)
call timed        : ellpadicregulator(E, p, n, G)
repeats per case  : 3, on a freshly initialised curve each time
precision rule    : n = 6 (p < 2000), n = 5 (2000 <= p < 10^4), n = 4 (p >= 10^4)
hardware          : timings are hardware-dependent; the paper's were
                    measured on an Apple M1 Pro (arm64), 16 GB RAM

       p   n             runs (ms)       min    median    paper
     101   6             [7, 5, 4]      4 ms      5 ms    5 ms
    1009   6          [99, 97, 96]     96 ms     97 ms    97 ms
    5003   5       [540, 535, 533]    533 ms    535 ms    0.55 s
   16889   4    [2323, 2287, 2283]   2283 ms   2287 ms    2.3 s

Each of the four calls returned v_fp(Reg_fp) = 2, as the scan files record.
TIMINGSDONE
